  "_comment": "Spell and ability effects (Phase 9), drawn by the client only. 'effects' is the library: each has a kind (cast: motes around a caster while casting; projectile: flies from the source to the target, then plays its 'impact'; burst: sparks thrown out; rise: motes rising; nova: an expanding ring on the ground; column: a pillar of light; beam: a line from source to target, then its 'impact'; marker: a sign over the head while a state lasts; aura: a ring at the feet while a state lasts), a colour (#rrggbb, or 'school' for the spell's resist school), and optional size, count and duration. 'events' maps combat events to effects; 'projectile_types' are the spell types that fly to another target before their event's effect; 'states' maps entity states to lasting effects; 'spells' overrides by spell or ability name (any of cast, projectile, impact); 'screen' sets the full-screen cues for your own character. tools/sync_client_content.py adds every spell's and ability's type and school by name.",
